  "dom_id": "questionExplanation-120355",
  "name": null,
  "problem": "",
  "worked_solution": "To estimate the probability that a randomly chosen person is an adult or prefers spicy pizza, we\n\n- add up the numbers in the row **\"Adults\"** or the column **\"Prefers Spicy\"**, and\n\n- divide by the total number of data points in the table.\n\nThe numbers in the row **\"Adults\"** or the column **\"Prefers Spicy\"** are highlighted below.\n\n|  | Prefers Spicy | Prefers Vegetarian | Totals |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| Children | $10$ | $22$ | $32$ |\n| Adults | $41$ | $27$ | $68$ |\n| Totals | $51$ | $49$ | $100$ |\n\nAdding up these numbers and then dividing by the total number of data points in the table $(100),$ we get\n\n$$\np=\\frac{10+41+27}{100}=\\frac{78}{100}=0.78.\n$$",
  "calculator_instructions": "",
  "fields": [],
  "problem_field_keys": [],
  "answer_fields_complete": null,
  "result": null,
  "proof_feedback": null,
  "html": "<div id=\"questionExplanation-120355\" class=\"questionExplanation\" style=\"display: block;\"><p>To estimate the probability that a randomly chosen person is an adult or prefers spicy pizza, we</p>\n<ul>\n<li><p>add up the numbers in the row <strong>\"Adults\"</strong> or the column <strong>\"Prefers Spicy\"</strong>, and</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>divide by the total number of data points in the table.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>The numbers in the row <strong>\"Adults\"</strong> or the column <strong>\"Prefers Spicy\"</strong> are highlighted below.</p>\n<p></p><p></p><p></p><p></p><p></p><p></p><p></p><p></p><p></p><p></p><p></p><p></p><p></p><table align=\"center\" style=\"border: 1px solid black\" rules=\"all\" cellpadding=\"5\">\n<tbody><tr>\n <td style=\"border-top: 1px solid white; border-left: 1px solid white\"></td>\n <td bgcolor=\"#F2F4F4\" style=\"font-weight:bold\">Prefers Spicy</td>\n <td bgcolor=\"#F2F4F4\" style=\"font-weight:bold\">Prefers Vegetarian</td>\n <td bgcolor=\"#D6EAF8\" style=\"font-weight:bold\">Totals</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n  <td bgcolor=\"#F2F4F4\" style=\"font-weight:bold\"> Children </td>\n <td align=\"center\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"152\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mstyle style=\"color: blue;\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c31\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c30\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-mstyle></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mstyle mathcolor=\"blue\"><mn>10</mn></mstyle></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></td> \n  <td align=\"center\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"153\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c32\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c32\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>22</mn></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></td>\n  <td bgcolor=\"#EBF5FB\" align=\"center\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"154\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c33\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c32\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>32</mn></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n  <td bgcolor=\"#F2F4F4\" style=\"font-weight:bold\">Adults</td>\n<td align=\"center\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"155\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mstyle style=\"color: blue;\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c34\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c31\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-mstyle></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mstyle mathcolor=\"blue\"><mn>41</mn></mstyle></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></td> \n<td align=\"center\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"156\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mstyle style=\"color: blue;\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c32\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c37\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-mstyle></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mstyle mathcolor=\"blue\"><mn>27</mn></mstyle></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></td> \n  <td bgcolor=\"#EBF5FB\" align=\"center\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"157\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c36\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c38\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>68</mn></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n  <td bgcolor=\"#D6EAF8\" style=\"font-weight:bold\">Totals</td>\n  <td bgcolor=\"#EBF5FB\" align=\"center\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"158\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c35\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c31\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>51</mn></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></td>\n  <td bgcolor=\"#EBF5FB\" align=\"center\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"159\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c34\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c39\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>49</mn></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></td>\n  <td bgcolor=\"#D6EAF8\" align=\"center\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"160\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c31\"></mjx-c><mjx-c cl